Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 23:29:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add kitchen Clock In/Out kiosk with PIN pad and home
 widget

Promote Clock In/Out into Live Ops, add PIN-pad kiosk (auto toggle),
staff cards, today's attendance log, home dashboard widget, demo PINs
for all kitchens, and persistent clock sessions.
